@baseUrl = http://localhost:5164
@contractId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@visitId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
# Configure accessToken privately. Choose today or a future GMT+7 calendar date.

### VIS-002
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/{{contractId}}/return-visits
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "visitDate": "2027-01-28" }

### VIS-005
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/visits/{{visitId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "visitDate": "2027-01-29" }

### VIS-006
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/visits/{{visitId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Customer changed return plans." }

### CON-005 (missing contract returns RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/{{contractId}}/return-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
